WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.070 --> 00:00:01.070
OK.

00:00:01.070 --> 00:00:06.100
Let's get into your questions, first one is,
hey, David, how will a vaccine before November

00:00:06.100 --> 00:00:08.640
1st affect the election?

00:00:08.640 --> 00:00:14.710
Even how this is asked needs to be clarified
because there is not going to be a vaccine

00:00:14.710 --> 00:00:18.880
before November 1st in the sense that anybody
is really going to be getting it.

00:00:18.880 --> 00:00:25.850
The absolute best case scenario would be that
a vaccine approval is announced sometime in

00:00:25.850 --> 00:00:28.250
October before the election.

00:00:28.250 --> 00:00:33.430
And presumably what that will mean is that
it is an emergency use authorization from

00:00:33.430 --> 00:00:34.579
Trump's FDA.

00:00:34.579 --> 00:00:37.710
Whether we trust it or not, is a different
question.

00:00:37.710 --> 00:00:41.910
It is very unlikely that a full approval for
a vaccine will come in October, although it's

00:00:41.910 --> 00:00:42.910
possible.

00:00:42.910 --> 00:00:48.370
But either way, the point of Donald Trump
doing this, which I've predicted for months,

00:00:48.370 --> 00:00:52.850
that sometime during October it will be we
got it, we got the vaccine.

00:00:52.850 --> 00:00:58.620
The point of this will be to associate himself
with getting the vaccine even if the vaccine

00:00:58.620 --> 00:00:59.620
is from another country.

00:00:59.620 --> 00:01:03.530
As we know, the UK is very far ahead on vaccines
and so are many other countries.

00:01:03.530 --> 00:01:06.330
And it is going to be a PR and optics play.

00:01:06.330 --> 00:01:11.610
Now, a lot of people are pointing to this
letter that was sent out by the CDC last week,

00:01:11.610 --> 00:01:17.329
which I covered, which tells states be ready
to distribute a vaccine by the end of October

00:01:17.329 --> 00:01:19.060
or early November.

00:01:19.060 --> 00:01:24.320
And there are many who are interpreting that
to mean that there might be hundreds of millions

00:01:24.320 --> 00:01:29.049
of doses actually being distributed on that
date.

00:01:29.049 --> 00:01:32.490
And that is not actually the likely scenario.

00:01:32.490 --> 00:01:38.100
What the letter says is states should have
their plan in place for how to distribute

00:01:38.100 --> 00:01:39.100
the vaccine.

00:01:39.100 --> 00:01:44.680
By that time, it does not actually suggest
that states will have millions of doses to

00:01:44.680 --> 00:01:46.900
distribute by that time.

00:01:46.900 --> 00:01:55.130
Now, in terms of let's play it out, Trump
announces a vaccine and says we did it were

00:01:55.130 --> 00:01:57.160
the first to do it.

00:01:57.160 --> 00:02:02.450
The FDA has determined that this vaccine is
safe and we are issuing an emergency use authorization

00:02:02.450 --> 00:02:06.899
and will immediately start sending vaccines
around.

00:02:06.899 --> 00:02:08.810
How much of an impact would that have?

00:02:08.810 --> 00:02:12.280
First of all, it would be a smaller impact
than in previous elections.

00:02:12.280 --> 00:02:13.280
Why?

00:02:13.280 --> 00:02:17.050
Because more people than ever are expected
to vote early and to vote absentee, meaning

00:02:17.050 --> 00:02:20.980
that even if you don't go and vote early in
person, you will have mailed your absentee

00:02:20.980 --> 00:02:25.641
ballot already, meaning that something that
happens on October 15th or 20th or 25th may

00:02:25.641 --> 00:02:30.260
well have less of an impact this time around
than it would have in the past.

00:02:30.260 --> 00:02:35.080
The other thing is, I don't know that that
many people are going to fall for it.

00:02:35.080 --> 00:02:41.160
If you look at more of a qualitative analysis
like the one done by Allan Lichtman, for example,

00:02:41.160 --> 00:02:48.740
or or or some other election prediction, here's
the cake gets baked earlier than the middle

00:02:48.740 --> 00:02:51.350
of October or November 1st or whatever.

00:02:51.350 --> 00:02:55.060
The case may be the only counter to that.

00:02:55.060 --> 00:02:58.900
And I do think it's a relevant counter is
that if the election is expected to be close

00:02:58.900 --> 00:03:03.221
from an electoral standpoint, even if Biden
wins the popular vote by a few points, as

00:03:03.221 --> 00:03:08.880
he well may, you could still have an electoral
victory for Donald Trump based on a few states.

00:03:08.880 --> 00:03:15.680
If Donald Trump's announcement of a vaccine
emergency use authorization on October 25th,

00:03:15.680 --> 00:03:26.080
for example, shifts just one percent of the
value of the votes in some states, it is conceivable

00:03:26.080 --> 00:03:30.920
mathematically that that would shift the results
from Joe Biden to Donald Trump.

00:03:30.920 --> 00:03:36.280
And so that's why we need to anticipate that
this is going to happen, because I've been

00:03:36.280 --> 00:03:37.920
predicting it for months.

00:03:37.920 --> 00:03:42.100
We need to anticipate that the voter suppression
that is likely to be done is not going to

00:03:42.100 --> 00:03:46.670
figure into the polls that the voter purges,
that the messing with the post office.

00:03:46.670 --> 00:03:50.500
None of this stuff is going to be in the polling
numbers.

00:03:50.500 --> 00:03:55.140
And thus we need to do everything we can to
get out the vote to understand that even in

00:03:55.140 --> 00:03:59.900
blue states, we need to run up the score,
even in red states that Biden will lose.

00:03:59.900 --> 00:04:04.820
We need to get as many votes for Biden as
possible to have the most overwhelming possible

00:04:04.820 --> 00:04:08.110
popular vote victory in order to make it more
difficult.

00:04:08.110 --> 00:04:09.110
That's all we're trying to do.

00:04:09.110 --> 00:04:14.570
We're trying to make it more difficult for
a court if it comes down to a court saying

00:04:14.570 --> 00:04:18.510
you can keep counting absentee ballots or
you have to stop.

00:04:18.510 --> 00:04:22.200
That it makes the decision more difficult
for them.

00:04:22.200 --> 00:04:29.280
If the popular vote is overwhelming in favor
of Joe Biden, I do predict that sometime between

00:04:29.280 --> 00:04:35.090
October 20th and November 1st, the White House
is going to send Trump to some facility, maybe

00:04:35.090 --> 00:04:36.090
a pharmacy.

00:04:36.090 --> 00:04:37.690
Listen, this guy's depraved.

00:04:37.690 --> 00:04:44.250
I could imagine him going to SEVIS and announcing
we are issuing an emergency use authorization

00:04:44.250 --> 00:04:45.590
for a corona virus vaccine.

00:04:45.590 --> 00:04:48.100
There will be no such vaccine at that CBS.

00:04:48.100 --> 00:04:49.590
It will be a photo op.

00:04:49.590 --> 00:04:54.060
And I worry that it could actually convince
one or two percent of the population in some

00:04:54.060 --> 00:04:56.720
states and it would be very, very bad for
Joe Biden.

00:04:56.720 --> 00:06:23.550
So let's 
be ready.

